{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e15b3f7f2fd0eb8edb527c2b2f60a6a8cee31e701aed370159907f606730f442", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ！　なんか、自分が\nあのステージに立ってたことが、まだ信じられないよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！我居然能够站上\n那么棒的舞台，总觉得还很难以置信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "bbf2c7105cd1370c832f231b83f4adc47078b9bfccb122bf30141ee2cb752736", "ja": "お疲れ、歩。確かにライブの時の歩は、いつもより\n元気だな。高いところでも怖がらないし……。", "zh": "辛苦啦，步，演唱会上的你的确比平常更有活力呢。\n就算站到高处也完全没有害怕的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b973151a9d441a8e2742ae391c9bb63408a218266055e3b7738a8c513c9f6182", "ja": "も～っ、{$P$}？　せっかく\nカッコよくキメたんだから、そういうコト言わない！", "zh": "哎呀～{$P$}？我好不容易\n表现得那么帅气，别说那种话啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "98d65c9ff6dad15f0d2278e3a7eb798392bcd143eebbe085ba7efbbfd0d76179", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n今日の歩は、最高にカッコよかった！　保証するよ。", "zh": "哈哈，你说得对。\n今天的步，帅到不行喔！我可以打包票。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a1948dfee8b1e8b99c283bc88f8581f9ff7d2e6d0a60e44a747f2e099d29016a", "ja": "えへへ……ま、まぁね。\nそう言われると、なんか照れちゃうけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……还、还好啦。\n被你这么一说，总觉得有点害羞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "961a15261233fdb7256731e903ccf952fbeca6783b0258937ffdcec1a3006f56", "ja": "歩、疲れてないか？　もうすぐ迎えの車が来るから、\nもうちょっとだけ待っててくれよ。", "zh": "步，你会累吗？接送的车就快来了，\n再稍等一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5254a635ebfcd24d19d038a55e86ef8ccfedad85d9941a290d4f6c6d39c05ccc", "ja": "そ、そんなの、気にしなくていいって！　\nそれよりさ、{$P$}……。", "zh": "那、那种事用不着在意啦！\n比起这个，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "53bb75ffef36f526d2422a03e7f11734664f0e73567d2497878b9b7170f366ea", "ja": "迎えが来るまで……もうちょっとだけ、\nここに残っててもいい？　……ダメ？", "zh": "在车子来接我之前……\n我可不可以在这里多待一阵子？不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "118badd3cca4fa5b5d2a03fbc834a907f8340c817c6dbf3d1d59dc431753df56", "ja": "いいけど……お客さん達も帰っちゃったし、\nステージにも、もう何も残ってないぞ？", "zh": "可以是可以……但观众们都已经回去了，\n舞台上也什么都不剩啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e1ef004253c2c450842e93f00c84da501b3cbca1e2d02d1634eb9b5dc6e64669", "ja": "う、うん。でもさ……まだ、残ってる気がするんだ。\n会場中に、お客さん達の、熱気が……。", "zh": "唔、嗯，可是啊……\n我总觉得会场里还回荡着观众们的热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7305ba687d1e4a81ae8a4e9e60a87730bad233d6d2a2b0f29f4b3b7cc7e0d3ae", "ja": "ライブは終わったけど、熱はまだ冷めないんだって。\nここにいると、そんな風に思えるんだ。", "zh": "虽然演唱会结束了，但热情还没有散去。\n只要待在这里，我就会这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0b9395fb00d9c9e1e31732deaa3c635c19be8d2e5d1bfde081764a50d04ee21f", "ja": "そうか。……よし、俺も付き合うよ歩。\n一緒に、今日のライブの余韻に浸ろうか。", "zh": "这样啊……好，那我也来陪你，步。\n让我们一起沉浸在今天演唱会的余韵中吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f205074fec06e72774058f34f96de5f4b1147ee91f00f82cbbdc5abf46f87df", "ja": "ホントに？　サンキューッ、{$P$}！\nやっぱりアタシ達、いいコンビになれそうだよ！", "zh": "真的吗？谢啦，{$P$}！\n感觉我们能成为好搭档喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0023_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "984a93b3c75083368adbf090a49aede1f7580807e94af86fd095571d31aef100", "ja": "応援してくれるみんなのために、アタシ、これからも\n本気で頑張るからさ！　プロデュース、よろしくな！", "zh": "为了为支持着我的大家，\n今后我也会拿出全力加油的！拜托你好好培育我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
